// ModerationFlagItem A single flag: a comment flag, a profile report or a taxonomy comment flag.
//
// `target_*` is the comment author for comment and taxonomy flags and the
// reported user for profile reports. `comment_id`/`gallery_*`/`poster_*`
// are set only for comment flags, `taxonomy_comment_id`/`suggestion_id`
// only for taxonomy flags (`comment_body` serves both), `target_about` only
// for profile reports. `report_count` is the number of flags in the current
// view on the same comment or user, this one included, and `categories`
// breaks that down (largest first). `reviewer_*`/`reviewed_at` are set once
// resolved. `user_id`/`reporter_*` are null for legacy flags filed without
// an account.
